  "title": "Advanced Visualization Architecture",
  "diagramType": "subsystem-architecture",
  "description": "Internal architecture of four advanced COP engines: Historical Playback (eng-cop-historical-playback) for time-controlled mission replay; Data Fusion Visualization (eng-cop-data-fusion-viz) for multi-source fused observation display; Configurable Overlays (eng-cop-configurable-overlays) for user-defined overlay pipelines; and Offline Maps (eng-cop-offline-maps) for disconnected tile serving. Shows integration with the COP Orchestrator, Map Renderer, Viewport Controller, Spatial Query Service, Vehicle State Store, Data Persistence, and Core Event Bus.",
