      "id": "node-cop04-offline-mgr",
      "label": "Offline Map Manager",
      "type": "component",
      "engineId": "eng-cop-offline-maps",
      "description": "Manages offline map tile packages and controls the transition between online and offline map serving modes. Handles tile package import and validation, monitors network connectivity to trigger automatic mode switching, serves cached tiles to the Map Renderer when online sources are unavailable, and coordinates with the Viewport Controller to pre-fetch tiles for the current and anticipated visible extents.",
