      "description": "Persistent storage for offline map tile packages indexed by geographic extent, zoom level, and tile source identifier. Supports multiple tile package formats, provides efficient tile lookup by quadkey or tile coordinate, manages storage quotas and eviction policies, and reports package coverage metadata to the Offline Map Manager for gap analysis.",
